"Decoys you're flying — one name per line. Fly them from their own tabs (the BLE beacon's name in Send, the GATT host in Serve); declare them here so the scoring knows what to look for in the attacker's hearing." = "Köder, die du fliegst — ein Name pro Zeile. Fliege sie aus ihren eigenen Tabs (der Name des BLE-Beacons in Send, die Verkleidungen auch in Listen); das ist das Manifest, gegen das die Station sie prüft.";
