"The Watch is never asked to do anything — worn and paired, it already measures, and the readings wait in this phone's health store. A reading, not a live feed: samples arrive at the Watch's sync cadence, and every value carries its age. Read-only and on-device; raw readings are never written to the night log." = "Die Watch wird nie um etwas gebeten — getragen und gekoppelt misst sie bereits, und die Werte warten in HealthKit.";
